## Bundled fonts
- UI text uses platform fonts. Mathematical rendering embeds MicroTeX's unmodified
  math fonts from res/fonts/ in the executable. Their Knuth, dsrom and SIL OFL
  notices are preserved in third_party/microtex/res/fonts/licences/ and installed
  in share/typist/licenses/math-fonts/. External Greek/Cyrillic text font packs are
  not bundled.

